---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section>
    <div class="px-8 py-12 mx-auto md:px-12 lg:px-32 max-w-7xl lg:pb-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h1
          class="text-5xl font-semibold text-center font-display text-blue-950 sm:text-6xl text-balance"
        >
          What is the OnTrack Educational Framework?
        </h1>

        <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-left text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          <p>
           The OnTrack Educational Framework (OTEP) is a student-centred pedagogy built
            around the concepts of assessment as learning, iterative formative
            feedback loops, and mastery learning. It gives students agency in
            their learning while guaranteeing educational standards.
          </p>

          <div>
            <p>OTEP draws on:</p>

            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-3 list-disc list-outside pl-6">
              <li>
                <strong class="font-semibold text-blue-950">
                  Outcome-based learning,
                </strong>
                where tasks are explicitly aligned with clear learning
                objectives and grade levels.
              </li>

              <li>
                <strong class="font-semibold text-blue-950">
                  Mastery learning,
                </strong>
                in which students receive iterative feedback and multiple
                opportunities to demonstrate competency before progressing.
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            <p>This creates a supportive learning environment where students can learn from their mistakes, while still maintaining clear competency standards.</p>

            <p>This approach creates a supportive but academically rigorous learning environment in which students:
<ul class="mt-3 space-y-3 list-disc list-outside pl-6">
              <li>
                
                 Learn through iterative practice and reflection 
                
                
              </li>

              <li>
                
                 Develop durable foundational knowledge 
                
              </li>
                 
              <li>
                
                 Build authentic portfolios of work across their unit and their degree 
                
                
              </li>
              <li>
                
                 Demonstrate competency progressively over time 
                
                
              </li>

              <li>
                
                 Engage consistently throughout the semester rather than relying on short-term assessment “crunch” periods 
                
                
              </li>
            </ul>
</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>OTEP also creates opportunities for:
  <ul class="mt-3 space-y-3 list-disc list-outside pl-6">
              <li>
                
                 More meaningful integration of AI into learning and feedback processes
               
                
              </li>

              <li>
                
               Flipped and active classroom delivery models  
                
              </li>
                 
              <li>
                
                 Holistic and programmatic assessment
                
                
              </li>
              <li>
                
                  Open-ended extension pathways for high-achieving students

                
                
              </li>

              <li>
                
                Early intervention for disengaged students
 
                
                
              </li>
            </ul>
</p>
          </div>
          
        </div>
      
      <h1
          class="text-5xl font-semibold text-center font-display text-blue-950 sm:text-6xl text-balance"
        >
          Background to OTEP
        </h1>
        <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-left text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          <p>coming soon...</p>
        
        <h1
          class="text-5xl font-semibold text-center font-display text-blue-950 sm:text-6xl text-balance"
        >
          How is OTEP different?
        </h1>
        <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-left text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          <a href="howDifferent">Learn more...</a>
        
        
        
        
        </div>

        
</div>
</div>
        <h1
          class="text-5xl font-semibold text-center font-display text-blue-950 sm:text-6xl text-balance"
        >
          The 4 principles of OTEP
        </h1>
<div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-left text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
<p>OTEP units can be designed in a variety of ways to suit the context, but they all adhere to the same 4 fundamental pedagogical principles.
<ol class="mt-3 space-y-3 list-disc list-outside pl-6">
              <li>
                
                 Active Learning
               
                
              </li>

              <li>
                
                 Freedom to fail
                
              </li>
                 
              <li>
                
                 Achieving competence
                
                
              </li>
              <li>
                
                  Guaranteeing standards

                
                
              </li>

        
            </ol>
            <a href="fourPrinciples">Learn more...</a>

</p></div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>